<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>with me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">CHSKA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">love letter</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3u28D5AmAqzQZD6bToSr8V</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.467" end="00:10.467" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh, ooh-ooh)(Ooh)(Ooh, oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.915" end="00:29.915">Baby, l've immortalized you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.839" end="00:39.839">Facin' the top floor view (na-ah, ah-aah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.968" end="00:49.968">All my senses (all my senses)feel déjà vu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.103" end="01:00.103">Oh, whenever (oh. whenever) you do what you do (na-ah, aah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.857" end="01:04.916">With me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.916" end="01:09.711">Know love ain't ever been easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.711" end="01:15.379">I'll run to you in a heartbeat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.379" end="01:23.307">Like you are not far away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.307" end="01:26.009">With me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.009" end="01:31.046">All these stars live forever, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.046" end="01:36.088">You shine the brightest from Sixth Street</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.088" end="01:44.088">Across and beyond Milky Way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.525" end="01:47.774">Hold me closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.774" end="01:55.177">You're the one (hmm, ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.177" end="01:58.065">Be my lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.065" end="02:05.224">Keep me warm (nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.224" end="02:07.626">With me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.626" end="02:12.730">Know love ain't ever been easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.730" end="02:18.150">I'll run to you in a heartbeat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.150" end="02:26.150">Like you are not far away (aah, na, na-aah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.524" end="02:30.381">I've been to places</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.381" end="02:36.713">But nothing feels like home with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.713" end="02:44.713">I've been to places (With you) but nothing feels like home with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.354" end="02:49.382">With me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.382" end="02:54.193">All these stars live forever, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.193" end="02:59.608">You shine the brightest from Sixth Street</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.608" end="03:03.608">Across and beyond Milky Way</p></div></body></tt>